        "sid": "JOB 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwatuŋa daUzi mwadiŋi iyala ijina dindi diyi Yoba. Yenowu iyala wadiŋi walala woloka, muntu waakamini Nzambi, waambukili kuyuma yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wavweli anyanindi amayala atanu nayedi, ambanda asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yimuna yindi, nyikoku makombakaji atanu nayedi, anŋameli makombakaji asatu, aŋombi anyidimu ikombakaji, yimbulu yawakaji makulakaji atanu, niantu indi amavulu nankashi. Yenowu iyala waswejeli kutoha, wabadikili antu akumusela ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanindi amayala ayilaŋa nakudya yawŋa mumatala awana kwawu, iwu nefuku dindi, iwu nefuku dindi. Atambikilaŋa ahelawu asatu kulonda kudya nakunwa nawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelilaŋa mafuku awu akudya chawija hiyakuya nakushika, Yoba hakuyitambika, hakuyijilika, hakuhindukaŋa budidi yayeni, hakuyilambwila wejima wawu nyilambu yakushita hamuntu hamuntu; muloŋa Yoba welilaŋa nindi, Wamba kela anyanami amayala anavulumuni dehi, anahoshi dehi Nzambi chatama munyichima yawu. Dichi chelilaŋayi Yoba mafuku ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋi ifuku denjili anyana kaNzambi nakwimana kumesu aYehova, Satana niyena hakwinza nawu hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwila Satana nindi, Wudi nakufuma kudihi? Satana hakumwakula Yehova nindi, Nidi nakufuma kukutambatamba hamaseki, nikukwendujola mudahita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwila Satana nindi, Kambuŋami Yoba wunamushinshiki tahindi? Hikudi wakweseka nindi hamasekuku, iyala walala woloka, muntu waakama Nzambi, waambuka kuyuma yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Satana hakumwakula Yehova, nindi, Ochu Yoba wamwakama Nzambi chamukunkulu, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwunamukolekeli niyena, niitala dindi, niyuma yindi yejima ikoli kwi-ndo mbadi jejimaku? Ninyidimu yakumakasindi wunayikiswili nkisu, niyimuna yindi yasemunwina dehi mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ololaku ntahi chikasa cheyi katataka wukwati hayuma yindi yejima, wutali neyi wukubula kukuhosha chatama kumesu eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwila Satana, nindi, Tala, yuma yejima yakwetiyi yidi muchikasa cheyi; ilaŋa hadi yomweni bayi wukwatahu chikasa cheyuku. Satana hakufuma kumesu aYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dimu cheliluwu anyanindi amayala nawambanda adi nakudya nakunwa mwitala dawedi wawu weyala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kudi Yoba hikukwinza muntu, hakwila nindi, aŋombi adiŋi nakudima, niayimbulu adiŋi nakudiila kwakwihi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aSheba hiyakuyilotokela, hiyakuyitwala, eŋa, ni aŋamba ajaha dehi nampoku yakabali, yami inapuluki kanka wami hohu, nimoni kukuleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iku wuchidi kuhosha hikukwinza nimukwawu, nindi, Kesi kaNzambi kanaholoki kwiwulu, kanochi nyikoku, ni aŋamba, kanayinoŋeshi; yami inapuluki kanka wami hohu, nimoni kukuleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iku wuchidi kuhosha hikukwinza nimukwawu, nindi, AKaladeya adambula nyikanka yisatu, hiyakulotokela anŋameli, hiyakuyitwala, eŋa, ni aŋamba ajaha dehi nampoku yakabali; yami inapuluki kanka wami hohu, nimoni kukuleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iku wuchidi kuhosha hikukwinza nimukwawu, nindi, Anyaneyi amayala nawambanda adiŋi nakudya nakunwa vinyu mwitala dawedi wawu weyala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukasumuka kwisaŋa hikukwinza mpepela yeneni hiyikweta hambaŋu jetala jiwana, dinayishiwukili anyikwenzi, anafwi; yami inapuluki kanka wami hohu, nimoni kukuleja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoba hakunyamuka, hakutabula chi kovwelu chindi, hakutewula namutu windi, hakudinata hamaseki, hakudifukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Mwivumu damama nafuminumu nzekesi, nakafuntaku cheŋi nzekesi. Yehova diyi waheni, Yehova diyi natambuli. Ijina daYehova adikiswili nkisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwejimimu Yoba havulumwinuku, hamusupishili Nzambuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
